    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detect hidden warships on the map, reach the target score with limited resources, and empower every move with strategic cards! This single-player strategy and discovery game offers a unique RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.poster.avif?t=1751966698\" width=800 height=303 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.webm?t=1751966698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards with Distinct Abilities :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck to overcome challenging levels. Create unique strategies for each stage using a variety of powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/cb1b7385373754456957dac2f72afb8d.avif?t=1751966698\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Challenges :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of challenges in each level that push you to adapt your strategy and think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your aim, trust your deck, and sail toward victory.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detect hidden warships on the map, reach the target score with limited resources, and empower every move with strategic cards! This single-player strategy and discovery game offers a unique RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.poster.avif?t=1751966698\" width=800 height=303 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.webm?t=1751966698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards with Distinct Abilities :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck to overcome challenging levels. Create unique strategies for each stage using a variety of powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823830/extras/cb1b7385373754456957dac2f72afb8d.avif?t=1751966698\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Challenges :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of challenges in each level that push you to adapt your strategy and think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your aim, trust your deck, and sail toward victory.</strong></p>",
